# In the prompt, ^Y goes to the first line and ^V to the last; ^T swaps for the search prompt and
# back, keeping what was typed.
args: lines.txt
file lines.txt:
| first
| second
| third
keys: {Down}{Right*3}
keys: {^_}{^V}
keys: {^C}
keys: {^_}{^Y}
keys: {^C}
keys: {^_}2{^T}
keys: {^T}
keys: {^T}
keys: {^C}
keys: {^X}
